    "TitleKey": "ORS_ConstructionAid_ResourceGatherSmall_title",
    "Description": "Now then,\n\nYou might have heard about the recent attacks on the Orison platforms. Terrible stuff. The folks at Crusader are scrambling around trying to put it all back together and have contracted us to help.\n\nTo get them back on their feet what we need is construction materials. Can give you a decent pay packet for them too.\n\nIf you don't know already how to get construction materials, your best bet is to read United Resource Workers' <EM4>A Salvager's Guide to Material Collection</EM4>. That'll set you on the right path.\n\nOnce you've got the order ready, you'll need to drop it all off at <EM4>~mission(Destination|Target|Address)</EM4>.\n\nTa very much,\nHal Grimsby\nContracts Manager\n\nCORNERSTONE MAINTENANCE\n\"Building on the Foundations of our Past.\"",
    "DescriptionKey": "ORS_ConstructionAid_ResourceGatherSmall_desc",
